OL,3,AUK, France, Germany, Italy and Canada
OL,4,Acondemn Israel's West Bank settlement
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's plans to open up tenders for
OL,8,Fthe construction of some 1,200
OL,9,Fsettlement homes in a strategically
OL,10,Fimportant part of the occupied West
OL,11,FBank have sparked fresh condemnation by
OL,12,Fmajor Western powers.
OL,14,FIn a joint statement, the UK, France,
OL,15,FGermany, Italy and Canada called the
OL,16,Fdecision "unacceptable", external and
OL,17,Furged Israel to "retract the plans
OL,18,Fimmediately".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
