OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK, France, Germany, Italy and Canada
OL,4,Acondemn Israel's West Bank settlement
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll settlements are illegal under
OL,8,Finternational law and, under
OL,9,Finternational pressure, Israel held off
OL,10,Ffor decades on plans to build in E1 to
OL,11,Fthe east of Jerusalem.
OL,13,FMany of its allies and Palestinians
OL,14,Fargued this development would deal a
OL,15,Fmajor blow to hopes of a two-state
OL,16,Fsolution, effectively cutting the West
OL,17,FBank in two and isolating east
OL,18,FJerusalem.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
